[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0542","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0542.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0327","title":"SGI IRIX syserr 本地文件破坏漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统的 syserr 程序存在文件处理缺陷，本地攻击者可利用该程序以系统权限破坏或覆盖任意文件，导致系统不稳定或拒绝服务。该漏洞仅需本地用户账户即可触发，无需特殊权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0327"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-11-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:09Z","remediation":"立即应用 SGI 安全公告 19971103-01-PX 提供的官方补丁。由于 SGI IRIX 已于 2013 年底停止技术支持，长期建议迁移至仍在维护的 Linux 或 BSD 操作系统。临时缓解措施：以 root 身份执行 `chmod 755 /usr/sbin/syserr` 移除 setuid 权限位，并通过 `chgrp` 将 syserr 程序组改为仅受信任的管理员组，限制普通用户执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0542.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0403","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0403.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0216","title":"Linux Kernel inetd SYN/RST Packet 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux Kernel 2.6.20.1 版本的 inetd 超级服务守护进程存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可向目标主机发送特制的 SYN 和 RST 数据包，导致 inetd 服务异常终止或资源耗尽，无法正常响应合法连接请求。该漏洞影响运行 inetd 服务的 Linux 系统，攻击者无需认证即可实施攻击，且无需目标系统上存在特定监听服务。利用方式简单，通过发送大量伪造的 TCP SYN/RST 包即可触发，属于典型的网络层拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0216"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-11-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:55Z","remediation":"建议将 legacy inetd 替换为 xinetd，并在配置中设置 per_source = 5、cps = 25 30、max_load = 3 以限制并发连接和速率。或者迁移至 systemd socket 激活机制，利用内核 SYN cookies（sysctl -w net.ipv4.tcp_syncookies=1）和 iptables/nftables 限制入站 SYN 包速率（如 iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --syn -m limit --limit 10/s -j ACCEPT）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0216","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8abbfc77cc703e2fd85623576b0f07a0c8427eb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0216.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0216","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/ce91429859b5110820b1d31a41b0b1a3c67d9603/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0216.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0216.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62aa382b460e7aee53e2fc9ebcfd565bebdac259/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0216.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8954696320cbff8f7d95f98854cf0e72222fc646/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g7qq-2qq9-j34m/GHSA-g7qq-2qq9-j34m.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0216.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2bbcf0ff-3ba8-4c91-aea6-e3d5fdb0e178.json","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/linux.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0403.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1252","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1252.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0967","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer / Outlook Express / Windows Explorer HTML 库缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Windows 系统中的 HTML 库在处理 `res:` 本地资源协议时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可构造特制的 HTML 页面，通过 Internet Explorer、Outlook Express 或 Windows Explorer 触发该溢出，导致远程代码执行或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 Windows 95/98/NT 4.0 等早期版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。用户应避免在受影响浏览器中打开不可信链接，并及时安装微软安全补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0967"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-11-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Internet Explorer 至 5.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 IE 5.0 中修复。对于 Windows 95/98/NT 4.0 系统，安装微软 MS99-007 安全更新。长期建议迁移至现代浏览器（如 Microsoft Edge）以获得持续安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0967"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1252.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0543","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0543.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0328","title":"SGI IRIX permissions 程序缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 5.x 和 6.x 系统中 /usr/lib/desktop/permissions 程序存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该程序提供超长且精心构造的第4个参数，触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 sys 组权限执行任意代码。该漏洞已有公开利用代码，由 David Hedley 于 1997年5月发布。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0328"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"1997-11-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即应用 SGI 安全公告 19971103-01-PX 中提供的补丁，升级 permissions 程序。如无法打补丁，应移除 permissions 程序的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/lib/desktop/permissions），并严格限制可登录系统的本地用户账号，仅保留受信任的管理员用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0328","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19318"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19318"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0543.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0536","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0536.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0322","title":"FreeBSD open() 函数本地任意文件写入漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 操作系统的 open() 函数存在权限检查缺陷，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞以提升的权限向任意文件执行写入操作。该漏洞影响早期版本的 FreeBSD 系统，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限。由于漏洞利用需要本地账户，CVSS 评分仅为 2.1，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0322"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-10-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:08Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 系统至 3.0-RELEASE 或更高版本，该版本已修复 open() 系统调用中因缺乏权限检查导致的任意文件写入问题。如无法升级，可通过 sysctl 设置 kern.securelevel=1 提高内核安全等级，限制非 root 用户对敏感文件的 open 调用，并严格管控本地用户的可信度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6092"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0536.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0228","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0228.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0097","title":"IBM AIX FTP 客户端命令注入漏洞","description":"AIX FTP 客户端在处理来自恶意 FTP 服务器的响应时存在命令注入漏洞。攻击者通过在 FTP 协议响应中嵌入 shell 元字符（如管道符 |），当用户连接至攻击者控制的 FTP 服务器时，恶意内容被传递给 shell 执行，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 操作系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者无需身份认证即可完全控制受害系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0097"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:34Z","remediation":"建议升级至 AIX 4.3.3 及以上维护版本，或安装 IBM APAR 安全补丁（IX72452 / IY07246）。如无法升级，可使用 OpenSSH sftp 替代 ftp 命令进行文件传输，或在 /usr/bin/ftp 上通过 chmod 移除不必要的执行权限以限制使用。避免使用 AIX ftp 客户端连接不可信或不受控的 FTP 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0097"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0228.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0221","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0221.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0094","title":"IBM AIX piodmgrsu 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 操作系统中 piodmgrsu 命令存在权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者可通过利用该命令对用户组权限验证的缺陷，在未获得授权的情况下获取额外的用户组权限，从而扩大系统访问范围，执行越权操作。该漏洞影响多个 AIX 版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0094"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-10-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:34Z","remediation":"安装 IBM 提供的对应 APAR 补丁（如 IX66020），或移除 piodmgrsu 命令的 setgid 权限（chmod g-s /usr/bin/piodmgrsu），并限制仅授权管理员可执行，防止本地用户利用此命令获取额外组权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0094"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0221.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0219","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0219.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0093","title":"IBM AIX nslookup 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"AIX 操作系统自带的 nslookup 命令在执行过程中未能正确清除提升的特权，导致本地普通用户可通过调用该命令获得 root 权限。攻击者只需拥有系统本地访问权限即可利用此漏洞，无需身份认证或用户交互。该漏洞影响多个 AIX 发行版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议升级 AIX 操作系统至厂商已修复的最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0093"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-10-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:34Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 IBM 针对此漏洞发布的 APAR 补丁（IX73355），将 bos.net.tcp.client 文件集更新至 4.3.2.0 或更高版本。临时缓解措施可移除 nslookup 命令的 setuid root 权限：chmod u-s /usr/bin/nslookup。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0093"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0219.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0217","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0217.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0092","title":"IBM AIX 4.2.1 portmir 本地缓冲区溢出与不安全的临时文件创建漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.2.1 系统中的 /usr/bin/portmir 命令存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向该命令传递特制超长参数触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址以执行任意代码；同时该命令还存在不安全的临时文件创建问题，攻击者可利用符号链接竞争条件劫持临时文件实现提权。本地攻击者在拥有普通用户权限的条件下即可利用此漏洞获得 root 权限，影响 IBM AIX 4.2.1 及更早版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0092"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-10-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:34Z","remediation":"立即升级至 IBM AIX 5.1 及以上受支持版本，该问题已在后续版本中得到修复。如无法升级，以 root 执行 chmod 0755 /usr/bin/portmir 去除 setuid 位，并移除其他用户执行权限：chown root:system /usr/bin/portmir；同时在 /etc/security/sysck.cfg 中移除 portmir 条目标记。临时缓解措施可将需要 portmir 功能的用户加入专用组，通过 sudo 授权最小权限使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0092","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19306","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0092.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0092","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0092.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0092.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0092.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-673v-6c89-8w4x/GHSA-673v-6c89-8w4x.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0092.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4be848c8-03f3-452a-a9ce-ef9613324759.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0217.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0214","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0214.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0091","title":"IBM AIX writesrv 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AIX 操作系统中的 writesrv 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该命令提交特制的输入参数触发溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据结构以获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 多个版本，危害等级高，利用前提是攻击者具有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0091"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-10-28T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:33Z","remediation":"安装 IBM AIX APAR IX68518 补丁或升级至 AIX 4.3.3 及以上维护级别。如无法立即打补丁，可移除 writesrv 命令的 setuid root 权限执行 `chmod 0500 /usr/sbin/writesrv`，或通过文件权限控制限制非 root 用户执行该命令作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0091"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0214.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0210","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0210.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0089","title":"IBM AIX libDtSvc 库本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AIX 操作系统中的 libDtSvc 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向受影响服务发送超长输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用此漏洞可获取 root 权限，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 AIX 4.3 版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用，危害等级为高危。CVSS v2 评分 7.2，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0089"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-10-28T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 AIX 4.3.2 及以上维护级别，或安装 IBM APAR IX45523 补丁以修复 libDtSvc 库缓冲区溢出漏洞。临时缓解措施可限制不可信用户对 CDE 组件的本地访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0089","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0089"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0210.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1431","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1431.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1261","title":"Rainbow Six Multiplayer 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Rainbow Six 多人游戏模式存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向游戏服务器发送超长的昵称（nick）命令触发该漏洞，导致目标服务进程崩溃引发拒绝服务，在特定条件下可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响早期版本的 Rainbow Six 多人游戏组件，攻击无需身份认证，仅需向目标发送特制网络数据包即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1261"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:03Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于彩虹六号（Rainbow Six）多人游戏服务端，厂商 Red Storm Entertainment 已停止技术支持且未发布官方补丁。缓解措施：1）在边界防火墙设置规则丢弃包含超长 nickname 字段的异常 UDP 数据包（建议限制 nickname 不超过 24 字节）；2）将游戏服务限制于可信内部网络运行，避免暴露在公网；3）使用第三方代理工具对 nick 命令输入实施长度校验过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/12433","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1772","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1261.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1261","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1261.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1261.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rmr2-r6pv-p7gw/GHSA-rmr2-r6pv-p7gw.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87805/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1261.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1431.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1345","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1345.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1131","title":"SGI IRIX DCE secd 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IRIX 6.4 及更早版本中 OSF 分布式计算环境（DCE）安全守护进程（secd）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向该服务提交超长的 principal、group 或 organization 字段数据触发缓冲区溢出，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.4 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。厂商已发布安全补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1131"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-10-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:47Z","remediation":"升级 SGI IRIX 至 6.5 及以上版本，或安装 SGI 官方安全补丁。如无法升级，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中禁用 dced 服务，或使用 TCP Wrappers (hosts.deny) 限制对 DCE secd 端口的访问，仅允许信任主机连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/i-060.shtml","http://www.cert.org/vendor_bulletins/VB-97.12.opengroup","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1123","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1131.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1131","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1131.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24512263eb77d6af2cecd67bd2460f761fc94bea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1131.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-vmm5-jgw2-qm8m/GHSA-vmm5-jgw2-qm8m.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88463/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1131.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5135fc52-dd10-41de-82d5-6d8dda9e716a.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/e18a803826f5de26e56a6a31273d1b83fad61ed6/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1345.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0181","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0181.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0072","title":"IBM AIX xdat 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AIX 操作系统中的 xdat 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞向 xdat 程序发送特制的超长输入参数，触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 多个版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用，成功利用后可完全控制受影响的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0072"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-10-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:30Z","remediation":"立即安装 IBM 为该漏洞发布的 APAR 补丁（对应 AIX 4.x 及更早版本的 xdat 缓冲区溢出修复），或升级到包含该修复的 AIX 维护级别。临时缓解措施：执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/xdat` 移除 xdat 的 setuid root 权限，阻止非授权用户以 root 权限执行该程序；如业务不需要 DMI（Desktop Management Interface）子系统，可卸载相应文件集或禁用 xdat 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0072"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0181.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0169","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0169.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0068","title":"PHP PHP/FI mylog 脚本任意文件读取漏洞","description":"PHP/FI 的 mylog CGI 脚本存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的 URL 参数，读取目标服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 PHP/FI 1.0、FI 2.0 及 FI 2.0 b10 版本，利用方式简单，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0068"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-10-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:30Z","remediation":"立即移除服务器上 PHP/FI 1.0/2.0 的 mylog/mlog CGI 脚本文件，或升级至 PHP 3.0 及以上版本，该漏洞在后继版本中已修复。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器配置中禁止对该脚本的外部访问，并将 PHP/FI 替换为受支持的 PHP 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/3396","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/713","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19553","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15